      "end": 10456.62,
      "start": 10454.98,
      "text": "那 HR"
    },
    {
      "end": 10464.38,
      "start": 10456.62,
      "text": "that is why over the last year I have worked to find the origin of COVID-19"
    },
    {
      "end": 10472.24,
      "start": 10464.38,
      "text": "to expose the CCP's bio-warfare program and to identify those in the United States"
    },
    {
      "end": 10477.9,
      "start": 10472.24,
      "text": "who may have contributed to the CCP's evil plan"
    },
    {
      "end": 10486.38,
      "start": 10477.9,
      "text": "I have been greatly assisted in this effort by young anti-CCP Chinese men and women"
    },
    {
      "end": 10490.16,
      "start": 10486.38,
      "text": "accessing documents in the Chinese language"
    },
    {
      "end": 10495.48,
      "start": 10490.16,
      "text": "it is those intelligent and dedicated young Chinese men and women"
    },
    {
      "end": 10501.28,
      "start": 10495.48,
      "text": "who represent the future of a free and successful China"
    },
    {
      "end": 10505.7,
      "start": 10501.28,
      "text": "together we have learned much in recent months"
    },
    {
      "end": 10507.72,
      "start": 10505.7,
      "text": "make no mistake"
    },
    {
      "end": 10511.4,
      "start": 10507.72,
      "text": "COVID-19 was made in a laboratory"
    },
    {
      "end": 10516.4,
      "start": 10511.4,
      "text": "and was part of the CCP's biological warfare program"
    },
    {
      "end": 10520.68,
      "start": 10516.4,
      "text": "the evidence is now clear and abundant"
    },
    {
      "end": 10526.82,
      "start": 10520.68,
      "text": "one does not have to look any further than the structure of the virus itself"
    },
    {
      "end": 10535.16,
      "start": 10526.82,
      "text": "no one makes such artificial alterations as we see in COVID-19 to study nature"
    },
    {
      "end": 10542.0,
      "start": 10535.16,
      "text": "and the presence of those alterations cannot be explained by natural evolution"
    },
    {
      "end": 10547.14,
      "start": 10542.0,
      "text": "COVID-19 was meant as a bio-weapon"
    },
    {
      "end": 10553.68,
      "start": 10547.14,
      "text": "and its creation was supervised by the People's Liberation Army"
    },
    {
      "end": 10558.98,
      "start": 10553.68,
      "text": "it is a military project from start to finish"
    },
    {
      "end": 10568.86,
      "start": 10558.98,
      "text": "it is a fundamental principle of biological warfare to retain the capability of plausible deniability"
    },
    {
      "end": 10574.34,
      "start": 10568.86,
      "text": "that is the ability to blame nature for a disease outbreak"
    },
    {
      "end": 10579.48,
      "start": 10574.34,
      "text": "COVID-19 was designed to do just that"
    },
    {
